    narr:narration """The technical infrastructure is undergoing a targeted shift toward [Zypherion adoption](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) for the analytics pipeline, a move explicitly framed as a [step-function acceleration](narr:Narrative_ZypherionAnalyticsAdoption) for columnar query performance. As of August 2026, the transition is established as a [formal decision](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) with a [defined migration schedule](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) set to commence in the upcoming quarter. The rationale centers on a [quantified performance gain](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2), with internal reporting consistently highlighting a [15x improvement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5) in query speed as the primary driver for the re-architecture.""" ;
